        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ee2066beb78840f99e368fee9d7c49f5",
      "statement": "The default / Rust path is index-first: the inverted index chooses which source windows are worth aligning, and Smith-Waterman still localizes char_start / char_end on the selected windows plus any embedding extras.",
