    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cb8b6c2b8515447fb463372691d7c304",
      "statement": "The Rust inverted index uses conjunctive rare-token intersect: query tokens are sorted by posting count, the intersection of the rarest tokens is taken first, and the result is capped at max_candidates, implemented by both InvertedIndex.query and PreparedCorpus.query_index.",
